{title: Chand Mera Dil}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Hum Kisise Kum Naheen R D Burman}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Chaand mera [Dm]dil,        [G]chaandni ho [C]tum
[Am]Chaand se hai [F]door,        [F]chaandni ka [Am]haan
[Am]Laut ke aa [Dm]na,        [G]hai yahin tum [C]ko
[Am]Jaa rahe ho [F]tum,        [F]jaao meri [Am]jaan
[C]Waise to [Am]har kadam,        [F]milenge [Am]log sanam
[F]Milega sacc [Bb]ha pyaar,        [C]mushkil se
Ho [C]dil ki [Am]dosti,        [F]khel na [Am]hin koyi
[F]Dil se dil hai mil [Bb]ta,        yaar [C]mushkil se
[G]Yehi to hai [G]sanam,        pyaar ka thi [Am]kana
[G]Main hoon [E]Main hoon,        [Am]Main hoon
